This directory vendors the Steinberg ASIO SDK 2.3 source files needed by the
OBS ASIO backend.

The SDK's LICENSE.txt offers a GPLv3 option. This fork uses that GPLv3 option
for the vendored SDK files; COPYING.GPLv3 contains the GPLv3 license text.

The Steinberg ASIO logo artwork is intentionally not vendored because it is not
needed for compilation. References to the ASIO name or logo remain subject to
Steinberg's trademark and usage guidelines.